        {
            "slug": "wesco-hydraulic-post-lift-tables",
            "title": "Wesco Hydraulic Post Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Mobile hydraulic lift tables rated 200 to 6,000 lb, with manual foot pump or battery-powered lift and no-post, 2-post or 4-post construction.",
            "content": "<p>Wesco's mobile hydraulic lift tables raise loads on telescoping posts, with no-post, 2-post and 4-post designs depending on capacity. Manual LT models raise 3/8 in. per pump stroke, and PLT models use a battery-powered lift. Floor locks are standard on all tables rated 500 lb and higher.</p>\n<p>Capacities run from 200 to 6,000 lb, on tables from 16 x 16 to 32 x 48 in. with raised heights of 46, 47-1/2 or 59 in. Economical VLT Value Lift Tables are also offered. A power drive option and roller and ball transfer tops are available, and the tables are made in the USA.</p>",
            "line_code": "LT / PLT",
            "key_features": [
                "200 to 6,000 lb capacities",
                "Manual or battery-powered lift",
                "No-post, 2-post or 4-post construction",
                "Floor lock on 500 lb and up",
                "Made in the USA"
            ],
            "categories": [
                "Lift Tables > Post Lift Tables",
                "Lift Tables > Mobile Lift Tables",
