        {
            "slug": "wesco-hclt-precision-lift-tables",
            "title": "Wesco HCLT Precision Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Hand-crank mobile lift tables with lift screws at all four corners for drift-free positioning, rated 2,200 lb.",
            "content": "<p>HCLT Precision Lift Tables are for work positioning that needs infinite height adjustment with no drift or tilt, including off-center loads. Heavy-duty lift screws at all four corners carry the platform, driven through a chain drive by a 13 in. crank at either end of the table.</p>\n<p>They are rated 2,200 lb on 24 x 36 or 30 x 48 in. platforms of 1/4 in. welded steel. Dual-range gearing gives 1/8 in. of lift per turn for precise positioning or 1/4 in. for faster lifts. Five-inch cast iron or polyurethane casters with brakes and a heavy-duty floor lock are standard.</p>",
            "line_code": "HCLT",
            "key_features": [
                "Four-corner screw lift",
                "No drift or tilt",
                "2,200 lb capacity",
                "Two lift speeds",
                "Crank at both ends"
            ],
            "categories": [
                "Lift Tables > Mobile Lift Tables",
                "Lift Tables > Manual Lift Tables"
            ],
            "sources": [
                "https://catalog.wescomfg.com/viewitems/lift-equipment/wesco-hclt-series-precision-lift-tables"
            ],
            "capacity_range": "2,200 lbs",
            "applications": [
                "Assembly and Production"
            ]
        },
        {
            "slug": "wesco-ppl-pallet-leveler",
            "title": "Wesco PPL Pallet Leveler",
            "excerpt": "A spring pallet leveler with a rotating carousel that lowers as a pallet is loaded, for loads up to 4,500 lb.",
            "content": "<p>The Wesco Pallet Leveler lowers progressively as a pallet is loaded and rises as it is unloaded, keeping the work at a comfortable height to reduce bending and lifting. Three heavy-duty calibrated springs are used in combination to suit the load range.</p>\n<p>A bearing-supported carousel turns easily for access to all sides, and built-in fork pockets make it easy to move. The PPL and PL models handle loads up to 4,500 lb, with a 40-3/4 in. carousel.</p>",
            "line_code": "PPL",
            "capacity_range": "Up to 4,500 lbs",
            "key_features": [
                "Spring self-leveling",
                "Up to 4,500 lb",
                "Bearing-supported rotating carousel",
                "Built-in fork pockets"
            ],
